                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Neman Yesu inkang'itie pooki sapuki o nkutiti, neiteng'enisho too nkajijik enye e ntumo, nelikioo ilomon supati le nkitoria e keper, neishiunye pooki keeya o pooki pukunoto e mueyian. ",
          "type": "text",
